# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Upstream-bundled CVEs in mcr.microsoft.com/playwright:v1.60.0-noble
# (used only by apps/capture-worker).
#
# Trivy scans the entire image filesystem, including pre-compiled binaries
# (CLI tools written in Go: gh, kubectl, docker, etc., plus an old
# picomatch in the image's internal npm tree) that ship inside the
# Playwright base image. These are NOT invoked by our runtime — the
# capture-worker CMD is `node apps/capture-worker/dist/server.js` which
# only spawns chromium via Playwright. The bundled Go CLIs sit dormant on
# disk and never execute.
#
# We cannot patch them without forking + rebuilding the Playwright image
# (out of scope). They will close when Microsoft publishes a future
# Playwright image with refreshed Go stdlib + npm deps.
#
# Re-evaluate on every Playwright base bump. Re-run `trivy image
# mcr.microsoft.com/playwright:vX.Y.Z-noble --severity CRITICAL,HIGH` to
# confirm which entries are still flagged before deleting any.
#
# Owner: @qasecret-maintainer
# Last reviewed: 2026-05-28 (v1.0.17 build-images run on v1.60.0-noble)

